Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.35,0:00:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,(夏洛克·福尔摩斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.01,0:03:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.51,0:06:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你闯进来是有目的的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,只要老实交待 就让你安稳睡去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得睡觉是什么滋味吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他说我过去为海军效力...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.81,0:07:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,在那有过一段悲伤情史
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.64,0:07:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我浴室里的电路坏了...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我老婆和隔壁邻居上床了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.15,0:07:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,造棺材的...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,还有...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我若现在回家...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.35,0:07:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,便可捉奸在床
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.32,0:07:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道他们俩有一腿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.14,0:08:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 这位朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这里只有你和我了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.83,0:08:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,为了找你真是花了我一番功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,《神探夏洛克》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.43,0:09:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,《空灵柩》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.65,0:10:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,(骷髅谜案)
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.12,0:30:26.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.04,0:30:29.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,(夏洛克·福尔摩斯没死...)
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.24,0:30:28.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.44,0:30:29.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.54,0:30:28.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.54,0:30:29.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.84,0:30:29.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.68,0:41:12.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,(松木?)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.71,0:41:13.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,(云杉?)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.95,0:41:15.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,(雪松)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.71,0:41:16.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,(新的樟脑丸)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.10,0:41:23.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,(炭灰)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.21,0:41:30.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,(烧伤)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.84,0:41:39.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,(炫耀)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.76,0:42:41.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.19,0:43:06.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,(我 怎么做到的)
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.51,0:43:08.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,(开膛手杰克 著)
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.76,0:43:19.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,(装逼)
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.16,0:43:26.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,(你忘了竖衣领)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.42,0:50:16.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,(选择吧! 救约翰华生还是詹姆斯·华生?)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.03,0:50:19.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,(多还是少?)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.03,0:50:19.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,(选择圣人或是罪人?)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.03,0:50:19.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,(詹姆斯还是华生?)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.46,0:50:51.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,(圣詹姆斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.92,0:51:17.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,(估计到达教堂时间: 10分钟)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.10,0:51:20.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,(加把劲 福尔摩斯先生 你还有十分钟)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.94,0:51:43.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,(还剩八分钟 倒计时...)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.09,0:53:09.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,(最好快点 这里越来越热闹了...)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.96,0:53:35.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,(静候行刑 延长2分钟)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.26,0:53:42.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,(预计到达时间: 3分钟)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.56,0:53:44.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,(预计到达时间: 1分钟)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.60,0:54:19.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,(真遗憾 福尔摩斯先生 约翰变成了盖伊!)
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.89,1:03:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.58,1:13:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,(拉扎勒斯计划)
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.23,1:14:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,(拉扎勒斯计划开始实施)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.35,0:00:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是个戏法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.29,0:00:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,变戏法而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a magic trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不 行了 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. All right, stop it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 就站在原处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, stay exactly where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别动  - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't move.  - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,一直盯着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes fixed on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了 你会为我这么做吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, would you do this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.99,0:00:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,做什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这通电话...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This phone call, it's er...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.86,0:00:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的遗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's my note.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,人们都这么做 不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what people do, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.71,0:00:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,留个遗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,留遗言干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave a note when?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,永别了 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.27,0:00:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不 别...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.99,0:02:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.99,0:02:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 看着我 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, look at me. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,睡沉点 再沉点 直接睡着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right the way down, right the way deep, right the way, sound asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.73,0:02:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.26,0:02:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 只有我的声音在你的脑海深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good, with my voice just there in the centre of your head
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,将你环绕\N{\fnArial\fs30}and floating all the way around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我数三 二 一...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will awaken in three, two, one...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.30,0:02:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.59,0:02:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,请让我过去! 他是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me come through please! He's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.20,0:03:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,胡扯!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bollocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.41,0:03:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 太显而易见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, it's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个手法 太明显了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how he did it. It's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.57,0:03:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为他是达伦·布朗(英国著名魔术师)啊? 别扯了 夏洛克死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Derren Brown? Let it go, Sherlock's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.31,0:03:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,当真如此吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体都有了 就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a body, it was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是他 茉莉·琥珀验的尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was definitely him, Molly Hooper laid him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不 她在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.05,0:03:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那是带着人皮面具的吉姆·莫里亚蒂的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Jim Moriarty's body with a mask on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,面具?\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.73,0:03:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,区区一根蹦极绳 一副面具 还有达伦·布朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bungee rope, a mask, Derren Brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.32,0:03:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,两年了 你的想法越发邪门歪道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two years and the theories keep getting more stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.25,0:03:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天还要跟我讲多少?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many more have you got for me today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道那边整个区域的地砖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know the paving slabs in that whole area,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,即便是他砸到的那几块\N{\fnArial\fs30}even the exact ones that he landed on,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.21,0:03:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它们都...  - 负罪感!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you know they were all...  - Guilt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是一切的根源\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是你和多诺万让我们大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pushed us all into thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.67,0:03:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,都认为夏洛克是个骗子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Sherlock that was a fraud, you and Donovan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你害死了他 但他不会再活过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this and it killed him and he's staying dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的以为你编出的荒唐故事够多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you honestly believe that if you have enough stupid theories,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就能改变既有的事实吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's going to change what really happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe in Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 既便如此 他也回不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, that won't bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,经过警方的广泛调查证实...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that after extensive police investigations...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.04,0:04:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,理查德·布鲁克的确是詹姆斯·莫里亚蒂捏造的人物...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard Brook did indeed prove to be the creation of James Moriarty...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,当夏洛克·福尔摩斯被洗清一切罪名和嫌疑时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amidst unprecedented scenes, there was uproar in court
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.52,0:04:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,全庭爆发出史无前例的欢呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}as Sherlock Holmes was vindicated and cleared of all suspicion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,很不幸 对于这位两年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly, all this comes too late for the detective,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.87,0:04:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,名噪一时的侦探 一切为时已晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}who became something of a celebrity two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,现在警方面临的质疑是 为何当时任由事态发展至此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Questions are now being asked as to why police let matters get so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.10,0:04:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯从伦敦巴茨医院楼顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes fell to his death
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,坠落致死 尽管未曾留下遗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the top of London's Bart's Hospital. Although he left no note,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.02,0:04:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他的朋友称他不太可能应付...\N{\fnArial\fs30}friends say it's unlikely he was able to cope with the...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.81,0:04:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 昔日友人不再\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then. Absent friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,敬夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,敬夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.11,0:04:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,愿他的灵魂安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}And may God rest his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,仔细听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.21,0:08:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,现在伦敦活跃着一个地下恐怖组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an underground terrorist network active in London
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.94,0:08:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他们策划了一场大型恐怖袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a massive attack is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 假期结束了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, but the holiday is over...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我的老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}brother dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.52,0:08:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,回贝克街去吧...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to Baker Street...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.67,0:08:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.60,0:10:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,赏点钱吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penny for the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.89,0:10:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 赏点钱吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi, mate, penny for the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.68,0:10:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,赏点钱吧 先生? 赏点钱吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penny for the guy, mate? Penny for the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.40,0:10:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,赏点钱吧? 赏点钱吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penny for the guy? Penny for the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.16,0:10:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真是我做过最荒唐的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the most ridiculous thing I've ever done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你还入侵了阿富汗呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You invaded Afghanistan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你倒是没闲着 是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been busy, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真是勤劳的小蜜蜂  - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Quite the busy little bee.  - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我花了两年时间 才捣毁了莫里亚蒂的犯罪网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moriarty's network. Took me two years to dismantle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.16,0:11:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定消灭干净了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're confident you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.40,0:11:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,塞尔维亚那边是整个拼图的最后一块了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Serbian side was the last piece of the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 你在莫佩尔蒂男爵的案子里牵涉挺深\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. You got yourself in deep there with Baron Maupertuis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.84,0:11:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好大一个阴谋  - 那是相当得大\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Quite a scheme.  - Colossal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何 你现在安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway. You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.88,0:11:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.53,0:11:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,说句"谢谢"死不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A small "thank you" wouldn't go amiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.29,0:11:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,谢你何用?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.49,0:11:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,谢我拔刀相助\N{\fnArial\fs30}For wading in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.01,0:11:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我得提醒你一下 我一般可不会亲自出马\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case you've forgotten, field work is not my natural milieu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.69,0:11:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,"拔刀相助"?\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Wading in"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.54,0:11:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你就坐在那儿眼看着我被打成肉酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sat there and watched me being beaten a pulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.16,0:11:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我助你脱身了  - 不 是我自救的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got you out.  - No, I got me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.73,0:11:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛不早点发话?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you intervene sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.37,0:11:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我总不能暴露自己吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't risk giving myself away, could I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.17,0:11:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一切都会前功尽弃的  - 你看得很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It would have ruined everything.  - You were enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 胡扯  - 绝对很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nonsense.  - Definitely enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 夏洛克 你知道当卧底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, do you have any idea what it was like, Sherlock,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.46,0:11:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么概念吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}going undercover?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.73,0:11:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在他们那种人当中潜伏?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smuggling my way into their ranks like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,吵得要死 那么多人!\N{\fnArial\fs30}The noise, the people!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.05,0:11:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不知道你还会塞尔维亚语呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know you spoke Serbian.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.85,0:12:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,之前是不会 但塞尔维亚语来源于斯拉夫语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't. But the language has a Slavic root.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.98,0:12:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,有很多来自土耳其语和德语的外来词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frequent Turkish and German loan words.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.67,0:12:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,花了我几个小时学会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took me a couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.05,0:12:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 风采不比当年了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, you're slipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,中年人了 我的老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Middle-age, brother mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.21,0:12:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谁也逃不掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comes to us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.39,0:12:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你不加糖的 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, you don't take it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.66,0:12:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不加  - 连这种小事都会忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No.  - You forget a little thing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来你还忘了不少小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forget lots of little things, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.10,0:12:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.94,0:12:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不怎么适合你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯?  - 显老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hmm?  - Ages you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.02,0:12:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,只是尝个新鲜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.28,0:12:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,太显老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it ages you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.36,0:12:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,听着... 我不是你母亲 我没有什么权利...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look... I'm not your mother, I've no right to expect it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不...  - 但哪怕一个电话也好啊 约翰!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No...  - But just one phone call, John!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.56,0:12:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,一个电话报报平安就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one phone call would have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.72,0:13:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们一起经历了那么多!  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After all we went through!  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.68,0:13:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我理解你心里很难受 在...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I understand how difficult it was for you after...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.96,0:13:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}after...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,哈德森太太 我已经放下了过去 都放下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just let it slide, Mrs Hudson, I let it all slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,只是不知为什么 越来越难下定决心拿起电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it just got harder and harder to pick up the phone, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.36,0:13:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂我的意思吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.08,0:13:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你对这件事重视起来 夏洛克 明白吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to give this matter your full attention, Sherlock, is that quite clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.31,0:13:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你觉得这衬衣怎么样?  - 夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you think of this shirt?  - Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我会调查你说的地下恐怖组织 迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will find your underground terror cell, Mycroft.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.27,0:13:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,送我回伦敦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just put me back in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.63,0:13:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要回到那个熟悉的城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to get to know the place again, breathe it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.63,0:13:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,感受它每一次心跳的颤动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel every quiver of its beating heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.44,0:13:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有一个特工在调查时牺牲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of our men died getting this information.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.60,0:13:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,各种渠道的消息都一致证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the chatter, all the traffic concurs,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,伦敦将会遭受大规模恐怖袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's going to be a terrorist strike on London, a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰·华生怎么样了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about John Watson?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.02,0:14:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 约翰?  - 对 你见过他吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John?  - Mm. Have you seen him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.93,0:14:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我们每周五还一起去吃炸鱼薯呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, we meet up every Friday for fish and chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.66,0:14:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然一直在留意他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've kept a weather eye on him, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你回来的事... 我们还没有告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't been in touch at all to... prepare him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.78,0:14:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.58,0:14:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要解决掉这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we'll have to get rid of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.74,0:14:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们?  - 太显老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We?  - He looks ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想别人看见我和一个老头在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be seen to be wandering around with an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不敢把房子租出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't face letting it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他从不让我打扫灰尘\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never liked me dusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.22,0:14:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.38,0:14:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那现在呢? 你怎么改变主意了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why now? What changed your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.23,0:15:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,有件事我想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've got some news.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.11,0:15:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 不会吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, is it serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.59,0:15:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,什么? 不 不 我没病\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No, no, I'm not ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.95,0:15:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好 我要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've, well, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,开始新生活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.27,0:15:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你要离开这里了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're emigrating?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.07,0:15:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不 嗯 不对 我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. Er, no, I've er...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.35,0:15:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我遇见了某个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have met someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.79,0:15:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,噢! 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Ah, lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是 我们要结婚了 我要去求婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We're getting married. Well, I'm going to ask, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.59,0:15:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克刚去世没多久呀?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So soon after Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.31,0:15:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.15,0:15:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是个女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.43,0:15:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 女的?  - 是啊 当然是女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A woman?!  - Yes, of course it's a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你真的想通了 是吗?  - 哈德森太太 我说过多少次了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You really have moved on, haven't you?  - Mrs Hudson, how many times?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.67,0:15:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克不是我的男朋友!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock was not my boyfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.99,0:15:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,与人和平共存 这是我的座右铭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live and let live, that's my motto.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.63,0:15:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我不是同性恋!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. I am not gay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.97,0:15:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我想给约翰一个惊喜 他会很高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll surprise John. He'll be delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.09,0:15:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么觉得?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.09,0:15:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 突然出现在贝克街上 比如从蛋糕里突然跳出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, pop into Baker Street, who knows, jump out of a cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.01,0:15:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,贝克街? 他早就已经不在那里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baker Street? He isn't there any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.53,0:15:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么还留在那? 已经过去两年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he be? It's been two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.81,0:16:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经有了自己的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got on with his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.65,0:16:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不在 他生活个毛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What life? I've been away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.24,0:16:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他今晚会去哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's he going to be tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.48,0:16:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我怎么知道?  - 你一直知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How would I know?  - You always know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.59,0:16:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他今晚在马里波恩路上订了一家餐厅的位子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a dinner reservation in the Marylebone Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那家店不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice little spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.08,0:16:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他们家有几瓶2000年的圣埃米里翁酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have a few bottles of the 2000 Saint-Emilion,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我更喜欢2001年的\N{\fnArial\fs30}though I prefer the 2001.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我可以顺路去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe I'll just drop by.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你非常有可能不受欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it is just possible that you won't be welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.72,0:16:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在告诉我它在哪?  - 什么在哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, where is it?  - Where's what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.28,0:16:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.72,0:16:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.84,0:16:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,老哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 我能为您服务吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.00,0:17:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你妻子给你发了短信 可能她快要生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife just texted you, possibly her contractions have started.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.92,0:17:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 我真的非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sir, I am so, so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.08,0:17:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我这就去厨房帮您把它烘干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, please, let me just go to the kitchen and dry that off for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.24,0:17:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,您点过菜了 先生? 我帮您收走菜单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finished with that, sir? Allow me to take it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,女士 我建议您看这份菜单 两份一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, can I suggest you look at this menu, it's completely identical.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.68,0:18:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,需要点菜吗 先生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you with anything, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.12,0:18:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 我想要一瓶香槟酒 要上等的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, yeah, I'm looking for a bottle of champagne. A good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.68,0:18:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 这些都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, well, these are all
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,极好的上等红酒 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}excellent vintages, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我不擅长点酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's not really my area,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.24,0:18:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么推荐吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 您点的其实也很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you cannot possibly go wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果您喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you'd like my personal
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我个人的推荐的话...  - 嗯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- recommendation...  - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.16,0:18:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这酒单上的最后一个是我的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This last one on the list is a favourite of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.16,0:18:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你可以说 这酒让我想起了某个故去的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, you might in fact say, like a face from the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 我就要那个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. I'll have that one please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.76,0:18:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那种无比熟悉的感觉会让你惊讶!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is familiar, but with the quality of surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.40,0:18:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 别让我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.12,0:18:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我肯定让你大吃一惊 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm certainly endeavouring to, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.92,0:19:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉让你久等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry that took so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我吗? 挺好 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. Me? Fine. I am fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你找我来想问什么来着?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now then, what did you want to ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喝点酒吗?  - 不用了 水就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- More wine?  - No, I'm good with water, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.27,0:19:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.28,0:19:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 然后呢?  - 嗯 然后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So?  - Er, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.80,0:19:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,听着...\N{\fnArial\fs30}listen, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道有些突然\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it hasn't been long,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.76,0:19:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你我才认识不久...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know we haven't known each other for a long time...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:19:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 继续说  - 好 我继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go on.  - Yes, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.76,0:20:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 过去的几年来我很不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you know, these last couple of years haven't been easy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,遇见你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And meeting you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,遇见你应该是几年来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, meeting you has been the best thing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.84,0:20:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,最幸运的一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could have possibly happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.28,0:20:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我同意  - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I agree.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意 遇见我对你来说是最幸运的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree, I'm the best thing that could have happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.76,0:20:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉  - 啊 不 嗯...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry.  - Well, no, it's, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.56,0:20:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.48,0:20:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你和我在一起 玛丽 要是你能看到将来 嗯...\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you'll have me, Mary, could you see your way, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.28,0:20:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你觉得有希望...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could see your way to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.36,0:20:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 你会格外喜欢这瓶红酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, you'll find this vintage exceptionally to your liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.28,0:20:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,陈年的味道 新鲜的颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has all the qualities of the old, with the colour of the new.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.96,0:20:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 先别打岔  - 就像盯着一群陌生人看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, sorry, not now, please.  - Like a gaze from a crowd of strangers,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,突然在人群中发现一位老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}suddenly one is aware of staring into the face of an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不 听着 你能不能...?\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, look, seriously, could you just...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:20:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你穿燕尾服真是奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting thing, a tuxedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对朋友很关切 对服务生却毫不注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lends distinction to friends and anonymity to waiters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:20:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰?\N{\fnArial\fs30}John?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.64,0:21:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 怎么了? 怎么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, what is it? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.96,0:21:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 长话短说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the short version...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.80,0:21:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.28,0:21:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这样刺激你是我不好 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit mean springing it on you like that, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.36,0:21:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会让你犯心脏病 可能现在还会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could have given you a heart attack, probably still will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.80,0:21:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但我的解释是 给你一个惊喜挺好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in my defence, it was very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.52,0:21:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 可能解释得不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, it's not a great defence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 不 你是...  - 对 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no, you're...  - Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.62,0:21:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.32,0:21:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没那么严重  - 你死了 你从楼上跳了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not quite.  - You died, you jumped off a roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有  - 你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No.  - You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 我很确定 我自查过了 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm quite sure, I checked. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.88,0:21:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你的... 也能擦掉吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does... does yours rub off too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊! 天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你都做了什么吗?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what you've done?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.64,0:21:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 约翰 我突然意识到我可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, John, I'm suddenly realising I probably owe you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.48,0:21:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,欠你一个道歉...\N{\fnArial\fs30}some sort of an apology...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.12,0:21:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 约翰 不要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, just, John, just keep...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,两年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:21:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,两年啊! 嗯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two years! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.16,0:22:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.76,0:22:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.24,0:22:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我为了你伤心欲绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you let me grieve. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.64,0:22:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么能这样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.64,0:22:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.84,0:22:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 在你做出什么会后悔的行为之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, before you do anything that you might regret, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.28,0:22:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,先让我问个问题 就一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}one question, just let me ask one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.84,0:22:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的不打算刮了嘴上那玩意儿吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you really going to keep that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.92,0:22:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾计算过 邀请莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I calculated that there were 13 possibilities
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,上屋顶的可能性有13种\N{\fnArial\fs30}once I'd invited Moriarty onto the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.44,0:22:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望在任何一种可能性下都能存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to avoid dying, if at all possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.80,0:22:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,方案一 将自己弹射至一辆装满洗衣袋的货车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first scenario involved hurling myself into a parked van filled with washing bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.56,0:23:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不可行 角度太陡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible, the angle was too steep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.12,0:23:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,作为一个天才 你有时真是蠢得惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for a genius, you can be remarkably thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.44,0:23:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 我不在乎你是怎么伪造死亡的 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?  - I don't care how you faked it, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.36,0:23:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我想知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.20,0:23:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么? 因为我必须阻止莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Because Moriarty had to be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.92,0:23:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.92,0:23:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的是...?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, as in...?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.28,0:23:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了 为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see. Yes. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.04,0:23:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这解释起来有点困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a little more difficult to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.92,0:23:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我有整个晚上的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.28,0:23:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 呃 这基本是迈克罗夫特的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, um, that was mostly Mycroft's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.04,0:23:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 所以这是你哥哥的计划?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so it was your brother's plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.00,0:23:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可他还需要一个女性密友协助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but he would have needed a confidante.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.76,0:23:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.36,0:23:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.36,0:23:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他是唯一知情的? 只有他一个?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was the only one? The only one who knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.52,0:23:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,还有些其他人 无法避免 这是个复杂的计划 \N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of others. It was a very elaborate plan, it had to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.36,0:23:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 13种可能性中接下来的是...  - 还有谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The next of the 13 possibilities was...  - Who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.76,0:23:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,还有谁知道?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.60,0:23:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁?!  - 茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who?!  - Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 茉莉?!  - 茉莉·琥珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Molly?!  - Molly Hooper
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.32,0:23:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有我认识的一些流浪者 就这些了  - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and some of my homeless network and that's all.  - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.56,0:24:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.56,0:24:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你哥哥 茉莉·琥珀 以及100个流浪汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So just your brother, Molly Hooper and 100 tramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.00,0:24:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,哈 怎么可能! 也就25个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, no! 25 at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.52,0:24:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,说实在的 你没开玩笑吧? 真打算留着这胡子?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, it's not a joke? You're really keeping this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.08,0:24:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,咳 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.44,0:24:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,当真?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.84,0:24:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽喜欢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary likes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.96,0:24:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯哼 不 她不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, no, she doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.64,0:24:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她喜欢  - 她不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She does.  - She doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.80,0:24:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.20,0:24:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈 棒极了!  - 听着 我很抱歉 真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, brilliant!  - Look, I'm sorry, I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.08,0:24:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么告诉你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know how to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.52,0:24:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 不不 没关系 我连这个都没注意到呢!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, no, no, this is charming. I've really missed this!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.32,0:24:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就一句话 夏洛克 我就只需要一句话而已!\N{\fnArial\fs30}One word, Sherlock, that is all I would have needed!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.56,0:24:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就一句话告诉我你还活着!\N{\fnArial\fs30}One word to let me know that you were alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.92,0:24:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我好几次差点想联系你 可...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've nearly been in contact so many times, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.28,0:24:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我担心你会不小心透露真相  - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I worried that, you know, you might say something indiscreet.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.69,0:25:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 事态会一团糟 好比出袋之猫  - 所以这成了我的错!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, let the cat out of the bag.  - So this is my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.09,0:25:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪! 为什么只有我觉得这是错的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! Why am I the only one who thinks that this is wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.98,0:25:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么只有我表现得像个正常人!\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only one reacting like a human being!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.10,0:25:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 反应过度  - 没错 反应过度!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Over-reacting.  - Over-reacting!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.90,0:25:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 约翰!  - 就是反应过度! 你伪造了自己的死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John!  - Over-reacting! So you fake your own death and you waltz in here
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.18,0:25:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,又大摇大摆走了进来! 可是我一点也不觉得有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}large as bloody life! Shh. But I'm not meant to have a problem with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.06,0:25:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,因为夏洛克·福尔摩斯觉得这一·点·儿也没错!\N{\fnArial\fs30}cos Sherlock Holmes thinks it's a perfectly OK thing to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.62,0:25:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴! 我不想让任何人知道我还活着!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! I don't want everyone knowing I'm still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.51,0:25:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 所以目前为止这还是个秘密?  - 是的 还是个秘密!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, so it's still a secret, is it?!  - Yes, it's still a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.69,0:25:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你保证不告诉别人?  - 你发誓!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Promise you won't tell anyone?  - Swear to God!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.64,0:25:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,伦敦有危险 约翰 一场恐怖袭击即将发生 我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}London is in danger, John. There's an imminent terrorist attack and I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.84,0:25:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的帮助?\N{\fnArial\fs30}My help?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.79,0:25:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,承认吧 你想念这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have missed this, admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.07,0:25:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,追逐时的刺激 血管里奔腾的血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thrill of the chase, the blood pumping through your veins,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.23,0:25:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你我二人对抗整个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}just the two of us against the rest of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.58,0:25:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白 我说了我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand, I said I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.78,0:25:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,难道不应该这么做吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't that what you're supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.70,0:25:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,老天 你对人的天性一无所知 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gosh, you don't know anything about human nature, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.54,0:25:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,唔 天性? 不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, nature? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.62,0:26:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,人类? 不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.50,0:26:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我去劝他回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll talk him round.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.62,0:26:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你愿意?  - 哦 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You will?  - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.82,0:26:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.10,0:26:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你敢相信吗 他胆子能大成那样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you believe his nerve?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.78,0:26:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.30,0:26:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.70,0:26:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.82,0:27:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那玩意儿会让你丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those things will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.02,0:28:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 你这混蛋!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.58,0:28:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.50,0:28:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直在游手好闲啊 格拉汉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been letting things slide, Graham.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.74,0:28:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是格雷格  - 格雷格\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Greg.  - Greg.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.52,0:28:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,众所周知 在投入大笔反恐预算后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very common belief, with an anti terrorism bill...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.94,0:28:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,政府感到有责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Government feels duty-bound
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.54,0:28:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,尽快推动立法程序的进行...\N{\fnArial\fs30}to push through the legislation with all due exped...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.46,0:29:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 站在原地别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, stay exactly where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.94,0:29:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.22,0:29:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.70,0:29:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一直盯着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes fixed on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.94,0:29:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,什么? 发生什么了? 怎么回事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What's happening? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.10,0:29:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你会为我这么做吗? 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, will you do this for me? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.30,0:29:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,做什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.62,0:29:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这通电话...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This phone call...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.78,0:29:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的遗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's my note.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.46,0:29:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,人们都这么做 不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what people do, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.86,0:29:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,留个遗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.06,0:29:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,留遗言干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave a note when?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.46,0:29:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 永别了 约翰  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goodbye, John.  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.62,0:29:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.86,0:29:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.94,0:29:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,啥?! 你发神经了吗?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! Are you out of your mind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.02,0:29:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白为什么不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.54,0:29:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这和你的那些说法一样行得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just as plausible as some of your theories.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.70,0:29:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 劳拉 要是你不打算严肃对待的话...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you're not going to take it seriously, Laura...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.98,0:30:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我确实认真对待了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do take it seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.98,0:30:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们不需要戴帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we should wear hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.74,0:30:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我建立了"空灵柩"社团 让志同道合的人们相聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I founded "The Empty Hearse" so like-minded people could meet,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.38,0:30:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,推测各种可能!\N{\fnArial\fs30}discuss theories!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.94,0:30:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock's still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.78,0:30:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我确信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm convinced of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.22,0:30:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.34,0:30:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,哦... 我的... 天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh... my... God!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.22,0:30:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"他的行动悄无声息\N{\fnArial\fs30}"His movements were so silent,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.38,0:30:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼鬼祟祟 就如同\N{\fnArial\fs30}so furtive he reminded me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.14,0:30:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,追踪气息的寻血猎犬"\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a trained bloodhound picking out a scent."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.74,0:30:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 如同什么?  - "我忍不住想象 要是他选择用天赋对抗法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You what?  - "I couldn't help thinking what an amazing criminal he'd make
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.86,0:30:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那他会成为多么厉害的罪犯"  - 别读了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- if he turned his talents against the law."  - Don't read that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.22,0:30:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 著名的博客 总算读到了  - 拜托 这只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Famous blog, finally.  - Come on, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.70,0:30:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,过去的故事 我明白 但它其实并没有过去 不是吗? 因为他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ancient history, yes, I know, but it's not though, is it, because he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.02,0:30:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.62,0:30:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,洗脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having a wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.90,0:30:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算刮了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're shaving it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.70,0:30:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你讨厌它呀  - 是夏洛克讨厌它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you hate it.  - Sherlock hates it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.94,0:31:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 显然人人都讨厌它  - 好吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Apparently everyone hates it.  - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.14,0:31:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还打算见他吗?  - 不 我打算去上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you going to see him again?  - No, I'm going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.06,0:31:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那下班后 你会再见他吗?  - 不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, and after work, are you going to see him again?  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.26,0:31:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 我被胡子扎了六个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I had six months of bristly kisses for me
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.78,0:31:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,然后这家伙一出现...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then his nibs turns up...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.70,0:31:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是为夏洛克·福尔摩斯刮胡子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't shave for Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.26,0:31:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你该把这句话印在衬衫上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should put that on a T-shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.06,0:31:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别说了  - 不然呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up.  - Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.90,0:31:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我娶了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'll marry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.14,0:31:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,伦敦 就像一个污水池\N{\fnArial\fs30}London, it's like a great cesspool into which all kinds
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.26,0:31:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,各种各样的罪犯 间谍和流浪者都难以抗拒地沉沦其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}of criminals, agents and drifters are irresistibly drained.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.38,0:31:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,有时关键不是谁沉沦了 而是谁行动了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes it's not a question of who, it's a question of who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.74,0:31:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这个人不订报纸了 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this man cancels his papers, I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.10,0:31:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这个女人没把狗安顿好就离开伦敦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this woman leaves London without putting her dog into kennels,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.86,0:31:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.42,0:31:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我盯着一些人 他们是预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have certain people, they are markers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.54,0:32:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们开始行动 我就知道要出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they start to move, I'll know something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.34,0:32:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,就像老鼠逃离下沉的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like rats deserting a sinking ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.01,0:32:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,非常有趣 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}All very interesting, Sherlock,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.85,0:32:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但是恐怖警告已经升级为紧急戒备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the terror alert has been raised to critical.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.69,0:32:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,没意思 该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boring. Your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.33,0:32:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有可靠消息 恐怖袭击将要发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have solid information, an attack is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.05,0:32:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,可靠消息 秘密恐怖组织正在计划一场袭击...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solid information, a secret terrorist organisation is planning an attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.41,0:32:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,秘密恐怖组织就是干这个的 不是吗? 这是他们的高尔夫游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what secret terrorist organisations do, isn't it? It's their version of golf.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.05,0:32:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一位探员为此丧命了  - 这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- An agent gave his life to tell us that.  - Oh, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.61,0:32:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,或许他不该这么做 显然他只是想炫耀一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps he shouldn't have done. He was obviously just trying to show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.85,0:32:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你的这些"预兆"们都没有异常举动吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of these "markers" of yours is behaving in any way suspiciously?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.01,0:32:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.33,0:32:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 迈克罗夫特 但你必须相信我 我会找到答案的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mycroft, but you have to trust me. I'll find the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.17,0:32:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但要等到在线博客上出现一个奇怪的短语\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it'll be in an odd phrase in an on-line blog,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.37,0:32:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,或者一场去乡村的不速之行\N{\fnArial\fs30}or an unexpected trip to the countryside,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.25,0:32:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,或者一个错放的征友广告\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a misplaced lonely hearts ad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.57,0:33:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,该你了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your move!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.46,0:33:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经向首相保证过你已经开始调查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've given the Prime Minister my personal assurance you're on the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.37,0:33:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我是在查案啊 我们都是 我们手头不正做呢嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am on the case, we both are, look at us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.61,0:33:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死!  - 糟糕啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, bugger!  - Whoopsy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.09,0:33:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,处理不了破碎的心 多么有趣的暗示啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't handle a broken heart. How very telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.01,0:33:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别贫嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.57,0:33:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这句话太熟悉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That takes me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.09,0:33:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"别耍小聪明 夏洛克 我才是聪明的那个"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Don't be smart, Sherlock, I'm the smart one."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.21,0:33:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是聪明的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the smart one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.57,0:33:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前以为自己是白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to think I was an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.09,0:33:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都以为你是白痴 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of us thought you were an idiot, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.29,0:33:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没别的事做 直到遇见别的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had nothing else to go on, until we met other children.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.37,0:33:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 真是一个错误  - 可怕的错误 我们是怎么想的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yes, that was a mistake.  - Ghastly. What were they thinking of?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.17,0:33:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,或许是想交朋友吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably something about trying to make friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.57,0:33:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. Friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.29,0:33:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 你现在也开始交朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, you go in for that sort of thing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.49,0:33:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有吗? 从来没有?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't? Ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.13,0:33:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真是愚钝了 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you seem slow to me, Sherlock,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.97,0:33:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你能想象现实中的人是什么样子吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}can you imagine what real people are like?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.57,0:33:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我住在一个充满蠢人的世界里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm living in a world of goldfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.49,0:33:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 但我离开两年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but I've been away for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.33,0:33:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以呢?  - 这个说不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So?  - Oh, I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.29,0:33:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你或许给自己找了一个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought perhaps you might have found yourself a...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.97,0:33:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 蠢人  - 改变话题 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- goldfish.  - Change the subject, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.41,0:33:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧 迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest assured, Mycroft,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.53,0:33:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你的这个地下组织想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever this underground network of yours is up to,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.81,0:34:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这个秘密都隐藏在一些看起来不起眼或者奇怪的事情上\N{\fnArial\fs30}the secret will reside in something seemingly insignificant or bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.13,0:34:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 打扰  - 曹操到了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ooh-ooh.  - Speaking of which...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.73,0:34:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信 我就是不敢相信!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it. I just can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.61,0:34:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他又坐在自己的椅子上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him sitting in his chair again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.45,0:34:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太美好了 对吧 福尔摩斯先生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, isn't it wonderful, Mr Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.49,0:34:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我快抑制不住激动之情了!  - 哦 他抑制地非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can barely contain myself!  - Oh, he really can, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.45,0:34:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然表面上淡然 他私下里很开心见到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's secretly pleased to see you, underneath all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.53,0:34:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你指的是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, which of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.61,0:34:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.61,0:34:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们玩点别的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's play something different.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.61,0:34:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么能玩游戏?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we playing games?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.45,0:34:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,伦敦的恐怖警告已经升级到紧急戒备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}London's terror alert has been raised to critical,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.73,0:34:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在打发时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just passing the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.17,0:34:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们玩逻辑演绎吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do deductions.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.01,0:34:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,一个客户在我离开时留下的 你都猜到什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Client left this while I was out, what do you reckon?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.17,0:34:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.41,0:34:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,玩会儿嘛 好久没玩过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, go on, it's been an age.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.65,0:34:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我总是赢  - 所以你抵抗不了诱惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I always win.  - Which is why you can't resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.53,0:34:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这没什么诱惑的 只是一个经常旅行的焦虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find nothing irresistible in the hat of a well-travelled anxious,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.33,0:34:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,多愁善感的不健康的有着严重口臭的墨守成规人的帽子而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}sentimental, unfit creature of habit with appalling halitosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.49,0:34:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 搞定  - 也很孤僻 你不觉得吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn.  - Isolated too, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.33,0:34:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么孤僻呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he be isolated?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.61,0:34:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- "他?"  - 显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "He?"  - Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.59,0:34:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么? 就因为帽子的尺寸?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Size of the hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.77,0:35:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,别傻了 有的女人头也很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be silly. Some women have large heads too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.37,0:35:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 他最近才剪的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's recently had his hair cut,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.13,0:35:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以看到碎头发粘在里面的汗渍上\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can see the little hairs adhering to the perspiration stains on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.69,0:35:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,有的女人头发也很短\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some women have short hair too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.01,0:35:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 极有可能  - 虽然你没跟短发女人说过话 甚至没跟女人说过话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Balance of probability.  - Not that you've ever spoken to a woman with short hair, or, you know, a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.25,0:35:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,污点证明他身体不适 他很多愁善感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stains show he's out of condition. He's sentimental cos the hat
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.09,0:35:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为帽子被修补过三四...  - 五次 手工精细\N{\fnArial\fs30}- has been repaired, three, four...  - Five times. Very neatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.57,0:35:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,修理的花费超过帽子本身 是他的情感依托 还不止如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cost of the repairs exceeds that of the hat, he's mawkishly attached to it. More than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.65,0:35:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,一两次修补表明多愁善感 但五次就是强迫症的表现 超级强迫症\N{\fnArial\fs30}One or two patches would indicate sentimentality. But five, five's obsessive behaviour. Obsessive compulsive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.13,0:35:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不准吧 你的客户可是把帽子落下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly. Your client left it behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.53,0:35:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个强迫症患者会落下帽子?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What sort of an obsessive compulsive would do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.77,0:35:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,最早的补丁已经被晒得大部分脱色了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The earlier patches are extensively sun bleached,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.09,0:35:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他戴着出国了 去了秘鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he's worn it abroad, in Peru.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.53,0:35:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 秘鲁?  - 这是带耳扇的毛线帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Peru?  - This is a chullo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.81,0:35:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,经典的安第斯帽子 羊驼毛线织成\N{\fnArial\fs30}The classic headgear of Andes, it's made of alpaca.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.33,0:35:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是  - 不是?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No.  - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.80,0:35:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,冰岛绵羊毛 如果你懂行的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Icelandic sheep wool. Similar, but very distinctive,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.01,0:35:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,就知道很像但与众不同 我写过一篇博客介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you know what you're looking for. I've written a blog on the varying
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.81,0:35:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不同天然纤维各异的抗张强度\N{\fnArial\fs30}tensile strengths of different natural fibres.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.81,0:35:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你们很需要这个!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure there's a crying need for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.61,0:35:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说他很焦虑?  - 左边的棉球被咬得很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said he was anxious?  - The bobble on the left side has been badly chewed,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.85,0:35:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,说明他是个神经质的人 但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}which shows he's a man of a nervous disposition, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.37,0:35:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但也是个墨守成规的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But also a creature of habit,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.77,0:35:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为他没有咬右边的那个  - 一点不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- cos he hasn't chewed the bobble on the right.  - Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.33,0:36:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,闻一下经常被咬的棉球就知道他的口气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sniff of the offending bobble tells us all we need to know about the state of his breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.09,0:36:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 厉害啊!  - 基本演绎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brilliant!  - Elementary.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.53,0:36:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,但你忽视了他的孤僻\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've missed his isolation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.65,0:36:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.25,0:36:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 显而易见  - 哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Plain as day.  - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.49,0:36:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 昭然若揭  - 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There for all to see.  - Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.85,0:36:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一清二...  - 告诉我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Plain as the nose on your...  - Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.33,0:36:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,任何会戴这么愚蠢帽子的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, anybody who wears a hat as stupid as this
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.37,0:36:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,都不会善于和别人交往 不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't in the habit of hanging around other people, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.85,0:36:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不一定 或许他只是不介意与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all. Maybe he just doesn't mind being different.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.53,0:36:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他没必要就得是孤僻\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't necessarily have to be isolated.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.25,0:36:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.05,0:36:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.41,0:36:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他与众不同 那又怎样? 他为什么要介意?\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's different, so what? Why would he mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.25,0:36:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得很对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.33,0:36:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,别人为什么要介意呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would anyone mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.65,0:36:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不孤单 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not lonely, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.21,0:36:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.53,0:36:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 不介意的话我就回去工作了 早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Back to work, if you don't mind. Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.33,0:37:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 我也接着工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.65,0:37:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,萨默森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Summerson.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.97,0:37:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错  - 隐睾症检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right.  - Undescended testicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.81,0:37:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.33,0:37:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克?  - 嗯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock?  - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.17,0:37:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,和约翰谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to John.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.97,0:37:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经试着跟他谈过了 他的态度非常明确\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried talking to him. He made his position quite clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.09,0:37:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,放松 萨默森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax, Mr Summerson.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.65,0:37:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.01,0:37:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 滚...  - 咳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- F...  - Cough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.09,0:37:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.97,0:37:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,喂?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.21,0:37:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞文斯太太 鹅口疮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Reeves. Thrush.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.01,0:37:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.25,0:37:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要见我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.85,0:37:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 茉莉...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Molly...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.53,0:37:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯?  - 你想要...?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes?  - Would you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.85,0:38:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.01,0:38:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 共进晚餐吗?  - 一起破案吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have dinner?  - Solve crimes?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.77,0:38:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,呃...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.21,0:38:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么不好意思的 瑞文斯太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely nothing to be ashamed of, Mrs Reeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.65,0:38:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这很常见 我推荐一个疗程的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very common, but I'm recommending a course of...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.25,0:38:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,猴腺 普斯布瑞教授的案子就到这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey glands, but enough about Professor Presbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.57,0:38:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,哈克德先生 说说你的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us more about your case, Mr Harcourt.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.33,0:38:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你确定?  - 绝对肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure about this?  - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.89,0:38:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我需要纪录吗?  - 如果能让你好受点你就记吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should I be making notes?  - If it makes you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.14,0:38:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰说他就是这么干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what John says he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.41,0:38:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以如果我是代替约翰...  - 你不是约翰 你是你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So if I'm being John...  - You're not being John, you're being yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.53,0:38:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,除了我和海伦 没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, absolutely no one should have been able to empty
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.73,0:38:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,可以取走那账户里的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}that bank account other than myself and Helen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.49,0:38:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你为什么不认为是你的妻子干的?  - 因为我充分信任她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why didn't you assume it was your wife?  - Because I've always had total faith in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.09,0:38:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不 因为是你取走了钱 减肥中 染过发 注射过肉毒素 有外遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's because you emptied it. Weight-loss, hair dye, Botox, affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.29,0:38:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,找律师去吧 下一个!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawyer. Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.17,0:38:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,布雷克先生 痔疮\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Mr Blake. Piles.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.01,0:38:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 布雷克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Blake, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.73,0:38:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你的笔友突然不来信了 是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your pen-pal's emails just stopped, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.21,0:38:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他就是那个人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you really thought he was the one, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.01,0:39:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是你的真爱?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The love of your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.01,0:39:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,继父伪装成网络男友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stepfather posing as on-line boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.21,0:39:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.37,0:39:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,突然停止 让她心碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breaks it off, breaks her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.77,0:39:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,她放弃念想 乖乖在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}She swears off relationships, stays at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.05,0:39:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他还能得到她的薪水\N{\fnArial\fs30}He still has her wage coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.65,0:39:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,温迪班克先生 你是个彻头彻尾的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Windibank, you have been a complete and utter...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.49,0:39:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,尿壶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piss pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.89,0:39:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心 注射一点就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing to worry about, just a small infection, by the sound of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.09,0:39:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,通常是维纳先生给你看病?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr Verner is your usual GP, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.77,0:39:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 是的 从小到大都是他照顾我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah. He looked after me man and boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.93,0:39:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我在教堂街上开了家小店\N{\fnArial\fs30}I run a little shop just on the corner of Church Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.89,0:39:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,卖杂志和DVD光盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Magazines and DVDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.57,0:39:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我带了些你可能会感兴趣的美女哦...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've brought along a few little beauties that might interest you...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.37,0:39:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"三个打炮手" 这是个尤物 非常色情\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Tree Worshippers." Oh, that's a corker. It's very saucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.01,0:39:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还有"英伦小鸟" 同样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And "British Birds." Same sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.33,0:39:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我不用 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.53,0:39:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,"圣战"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Holy War."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.85,0:39:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道听起来很无趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds a bit dry, I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.41,0:39:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个修女她身上的洞都...\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's a nun with all these holes in her habit...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.73,0:40:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊! 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus! Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.25,0:40:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 你要干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?  - What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.25,0:40:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.49,0:40:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你来折磨我的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you come to torment me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.67,0:40:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么?  - 你在说什么...?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you talking about?  - What are you talking...?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.01,0:40:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我会被这愚蠢的胡子给骗了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, do you think I'm going to be fooled by this bloody beard?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.61,0:40:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了! 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crazy! No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.81,0:40:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,伪装不是你擅长的嘛! 这可不像你的法语\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not as good as your French! Not as good as your French.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.61,0:40:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,伪装得真差劲 夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not even a good disguise, Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.45,0:40:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪弄的这些东西 玩笑商店吗...?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get it from, a bloody joke shop...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.25,0:40:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.61,0:40:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,非常对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.13,0:40:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.73,0:40:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,请原谅...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.89,0:40:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.77,0:40:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们对这案子毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's got us all baffled.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.53,0:40:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我毫不怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, I don't doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.89,0:41:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.13,0:41:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你发现了线索 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're onto something, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.21,0:41:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.05,0:41:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 约翰  - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up, John.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.37,0:41:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.61,0:41:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨  - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello.  - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.17,0:41:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗?  - 我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure?  - I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.79,0:41:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.17,0:41:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,见卡斯要迟到了 一会儿见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm late for Cath. I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.69,0:41:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拜  - 拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye.  - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.61,0:42:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你的新搭档?\N{\fnArial\fs30}This going to be your new arrangement, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.37,0:42:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,让她试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just giving it a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.21,0:42:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.05,0:42:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那约翰呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, John?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.09,0:42:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,形同陌路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really in the picture any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.33,0:42:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是地铁吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trains?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.53,0:42:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trains.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.17,0:42:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,男性 四十到五十岁之间 抱歉 你想...?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Male, 40 to 50. Oh, sorry, did you want to be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.77,0:42:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没 请随意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, no, please, be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.85,0:42:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴!  (嫉妒了?)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.05,0:42:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这说不通啊 \N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.49,0:42:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说不通?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What doesn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.57,0:42:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这个骨架形成时间绝不会超过...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This skeleton, it can't be any more than...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.77,0:42:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,六个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}six months old.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.73,0:43:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,哇!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.65,0:43:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"我怎么做到的 开膛手杰克 著"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"How I Did It, by Jack the Ripper."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.21,0:43:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊  - 这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh-huh.  - That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.49,0:43:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到我的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.37,0:43:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想解释 怕侮辱你的智商\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't insult your intelligence by explaining it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.41,0:43:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不用 你随便侮辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please, insult away.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.61,0:43:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这具尸体是六个月前的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The corpse is, is six months old.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.69,0:43:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,穿着从博物馆里拿出来的低劣维多利亚时代的外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dressed in a shoddy Victorian outfit from a museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.77,0:43:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,赝品展出了很多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been displayed on a dummy for many years,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.89,0:43:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体面朝东南 从织物的褪色就看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a case facing south-east, judging from the fading of the fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.25,0:43:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,在一场火灾之后被变卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was sold off in a fire damage sale a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.53,0:43:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,所以整件事是假的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the whole thing was a fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.69,0:43:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.93,0:43:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去那么完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looked so promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.73,0:43:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,如此手到擒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Facile.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.77,0:43:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么有人会费心做这些?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would someone go to all that trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.77,0:43:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么呢 约翰?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why indeed, John?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.65,0:44:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,小心空隙 小心空隙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind the gap. Mind the gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.69,0:44:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢替我拿过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Thanks for hanging onto it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.29,0:44:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.13,0:44:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么事 史洛克先生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's this all about, Mr Shilcott?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.29,0:44:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我女朋友是你的粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}My girlfriend's a big fan of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.05,0:44:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,女朋友?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girlfriend?!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.17,0:44:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 请继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Do go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.85,0:44:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢地铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like trains.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.69,0:44:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 然后...  - 我在地铁公司工作 区域线上 \N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes...  - I work on the Tube, on the District Line, and part of my job
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.37,0:44:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我的部分工作是看完后抹掉监控录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to wipe the security footage after it's been cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.97,0:44:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我浏览时 发现一个奇怪的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just whizzing through and I found something a bit bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.41,0:44:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个星期前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this was a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.37,0:44:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,星期五晚上的最后一班车 威斯敏斯特地铁站\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last train on the Friday night, Westminster Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.97,0:44:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这个男人走进最后一节车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this man gets into the last car.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.25,0:44:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 车?  - 他们叫车 不是车厢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Car?  - They're cars, not carriages.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.33,0:44:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这是地铁系统美国早期留下的名称\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a legacy of the early American involvement in the Tube system.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.17,0:44:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他喜欢地铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he liked trains.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.61,0:44:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,下一站 圣詹姆斯公园站\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the next stop, St James' Park Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.29,0:44:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,然后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.93,0:45:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.57,0:45:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他在威斯敏斯特上的最后一节车 唯一一个乘客\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gets into the last car at Westminster. The only passenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.65,0:45:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但到圣詹姆斯公园站的时候车就空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the car is empty at St James's Park Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.41,0:45:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,解释一下 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explain that, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.29,0:45:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他可能跳车了?  - 有安全系统防止门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Couldn't he have just jumped off?  - There's a safety mechanism that prevents the doors
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.93,0:45:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,在行驶途中被打开 而且还有一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}from opening in transit. But there's something else,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.41,0:45:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那列车的驾驶员从那以后就没再上班过\N{\fnArial\fs30}the driver of that train hasn't been to work since.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.69,0:45:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他的室友说他去度假了 突然发了横财\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to his flatmate, he's on holiday. Came into some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.77,0:45:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,被收买?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bought off?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.25,0:45:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.81,0:45:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那么就是那位列车驾驶员在中途\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if the driver of the train was in on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.69,0:45:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,让这位乘客下车的\N{\fnArial\fs30}then the passenger did get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.21,0:45:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,中途下车也没地方去 这条线上没有停靠点\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nowhere he could go. It's a straight run on the District Line between the two stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.37,0:45:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,中途的隧道也没有维修出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no side tunnels, no maintenance tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.89,0:45:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,地图上没有任何出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing on any map. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.69,0:45:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,地铁没有停靠 但一名乘客消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Train never stops and a man vanishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.61,0:45:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,很棒 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, innit?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.69,0:46:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.01,0:46:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.53,0:47:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这两站之间一般情况需要五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The journey between those stations usually takes five minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.21,0:47:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但录像那段却花了十分钟到达 十分钟从威斯敏斯特到圣詹姆士公园\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that one took ten. Ten minutes to get from Westminster to St James's Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.49,0:47:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要地图 很多张 旧地图 所有都要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll need maps, lots of maps. Older maps, all the maps. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.81,0:47:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 想吃点薯条吗?  - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fancy some chips?  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.77,0:47:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道在马里波恩路边有个鱼薯店很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a fantastic fish shop just off the Marylebone Road,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.33,0:47:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,老板每次都会多给我一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}the owner always gives me extra portions.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.37,0:47:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是让他摆脱了什么谋杀罪名?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get him off a murder charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.89,0:47:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我曾帮他搬货物\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I helped him put up some shelves.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.73,0:47:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克?  - 嗯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock?  - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.73,0:47:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 今天为什么对我这么好?  - 报答你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was today about?  - Saying thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.69,0:47:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.65,0:47:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为你所做的一切  - 没关系的 举手之劳而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For everything you did for me.  - It's OK. It's my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.21,0:47:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.81,0:48:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是说高兴 我想说没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean pleasure, I mean I didn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.25,0:48:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想...  - 莫里亚蒂他疏忽了 犯了致命错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wanted to...  - Moriarty slipped up, he made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.01,0:48:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那个对我最为重要的人 他却认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the one person he thought didn't matter at all to me
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.33,0:48:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,对我无关紧要\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the one person that mattered the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.69,0:48:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是你让我成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made it all possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.37,0:48:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但你不能再做一次了 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't do this again, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.29,0:48:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天过得很愉快 我也很想去 可惜...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had a lovely day. I'd love to, I just, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.13,0:48:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 顺便祝贺你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, congratulations, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.21,0:48:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不是工作上认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.93,0:48:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是通过朋友介绍的 很老套的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We met through friends, old-fashioned way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.37,0:48:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他很不错 我们养了条狗 我们周末经常去酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's nice, we've got a dog, we, we go to the pub on weekends
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.53,0:48:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我也见过他的父母 亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've met his mum and dad and his friends and all his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.41,0:48:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我不清楚为什么我会跟你说这些...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've no idea why I'm telling you any of this...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.53,0:48:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你过的幸福 茉莉·琥珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you'll be very happy, Molly Hooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.89,0:48:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.49,0:48:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,看来并不是你喜欢的每个男人都是反动分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, not all the men you fall for can turn out to be sociopaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.93,0:48:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是吗?  - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No?  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.29,0:49:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我就喜欢这类型呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's just my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.01,0:50:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,哈德森太太 我觉得有人绑架了约翰 约翰·华生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mrs Hudson, sorry, I think someone's got John. John Watson?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.57,0:50:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,等下 你是谁?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.81,0:50:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我是他的未婚妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm his fiancee.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.49,0:50:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.13,0:50:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.57,0:50:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,有个人给我发了条短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone sent me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.05,0:50:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始我以为是圣经里的内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first I thought it was just a Bible thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.05,0:50:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的 垃圾广告 但不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, spam, but it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.37,0:50:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是跳步码\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a skip code.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.85,0:50:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,先是第一个词 然后每隔三个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}First word, then every third.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.77,0:50:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,"救救约翰·华生"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Save John Watson."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.73,0:50:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,现在!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.45,0:50:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去哪儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.77,0:50:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,圣詹姆斯 是个教堂 开车20分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}St James The Less, it's a church. 20 minutes by car.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.77,0:51:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你开车来的?  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you drive here?  - Er, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.37,0:51:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,太慢了 太慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too slow, it's too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.53,0:51:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,小心! 我们在等什么?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out! What are we waiting for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.37,0:51:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.53,0:51:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.81,0:51:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要对他做什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they going to do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.13,0:51:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.57,0:51:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,该死!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.89,0:52:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,喂! 喂! 你不能从那里过!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi! Oi! You can't go down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.77,0:53:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 点不着 这样点不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not going to work, with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.57,0:53:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我去找点助燃的东西  - 好的 \N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll get something to help it along.  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.93,0:53:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,救命! 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Argh!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.85,0:53:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他不喜欢被烧 爸爸  - 啊?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He doesn't like it, Daddy.  - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.49,0:53:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊·福克斯 他不喜欢被烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy Fawkes, he doesn't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.41,0:53:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,退后 佐伊 退后!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back, Zoe. Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.57,0:53:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.33,0:54:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么意思?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.23,0:54:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.65,0:54:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,救命!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.93,0:54:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,退后!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.17,0:54:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,闪开! 闪开! 闪开!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.13,0:54:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,闪开! 闪开!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.41,0:55:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰! 约翰!\N{\fnArial\fs30}John! John!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.49,0:55:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰! 约翰!\N{\fnArial\fs30}John! John!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.89,0:55:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,起来 约翰!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, John!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.33,0:55:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 约翰!  - 约翰?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John!  - John?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.05,0:55:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,救命!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.29,0:55:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰!\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.89,0:55:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰! 约翰!\N{\fnArial\fs30}John! John!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.61,0:55:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 约翰  - 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, John.  - John.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.41,0:55:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我没把它放在那里 笨女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which wasn't the way I'd put it at all. Silly woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.53,0:55:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样 就是那时我第一次注意到它丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, it was then that I first noticed it was missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.97,0:55:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我问他 "你检查沙发靠背夹缝了吗?"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "Have you checked down the back of the sofa?"
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.81,0:55:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他总是把东西丢在沙发靠背夹缝里 是吧 亲爱的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's always losing things down the back of the sofa, aren't you, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.89,0:56:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.01,0:56:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,像钥匙 零钱 糖果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, keys, small change, sweeties.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.49,0:56:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 尤其是他的眼镜  - 眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Especially his glasses.  - Glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.97,0:56:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,特别麻烦 我说 "为什么不找根链子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blooming things. I said, "Why don't you get a chain,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.33,0:56:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,把眼镜挂脖子上?"\N{\fnArial\fs30}wear them round your neck?"
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.77,0:56:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他回答说 "什么 就像拉里·格雷森一样!"  - 拉里·格雷森\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And he says, "What, like Larry Grayson!"  - Larry Grayson.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.61,0:56:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说你最后找到彩票了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did you find it eventually, your lottery ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.81,0:56:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yes, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.97,0:56:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们总算准时上了大巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}We caught the coach on time after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.13,0:56:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去看了圣保罗大教堂 伦敦塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We managed to see St Paul's, the Tower,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.13,0:56:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们不让任何人进议会大厦\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they weren't letting anyone into Parliament.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.77,0:56:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好像在举行什么大辩论会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some big debate going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.41,0:56:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 约翰?  - 不好意思 你在忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John?  - Sorry, you're busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.54,0:56:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不 没有 没有 他们正打算走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, they were just leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.01,0:56:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有 是吗?  - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, oh, were we?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.06,0:56:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别 如果你有案子...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, if you've got a case...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.49,0:56:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 不是案子 对 快走  - 要记得 我们一直待到周六\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, not a case. Yeah, go.  - We're here till Saturday, remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.94,0:56:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好 很好 快走吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, wonderful. Just get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.17,0:56:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 给我们打电话  - 很好 我会的 出去吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, well, give us a ring.  - Very nice, yes, good. Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.37,0:56:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们真的特别开心 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you how glad we are, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.37,0:56:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那段时候人们总是想着你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that time people thinking the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.49,0:56:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都结束了 我们觉得特别高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just so pleased it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.41,0:56:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,多打电话过来 好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ring up more often, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.05,0:56:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯  - 她很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mm-hm.  - She worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.13,0:56:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你保证?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.69,0:56:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.77,0:56:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for God...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.53,0:57:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不好意思  - 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry about that.  - No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.77,0:57:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,客户?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clients?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.93,0:57:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我父母而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.85,0:57:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你父母?  - 来城里玩几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your parents?  - In town for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.89,0:57:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的是你父母?  - 迈克罗夫特答应带他们去看悲惨世界音乐会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your parents?  - Mycroft promised to take them to a matinee of Les Mis.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.69,0:57:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,想让我也一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tried to talk me into doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.45,0:57:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那真是你的父母?  - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Those were your parents?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.85,0:57:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.41,0:57:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is not what I...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.65,0:57:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.45,0:57:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 他们好...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they're just so...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.33,0:57:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,普通\N{\fnArial\fs30}ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.09,0:57:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我不得不背负的十字架\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a cross I have to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.45,0:57:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也知道吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they know too?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.57,0:57:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 你花了两年的时间玩捉迷藏?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hmm?  - That you spent the last two years playing hide and seek?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.73,0:57:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也许吧  - 所以他们才没来参加葬礼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe.  - Ah, so that's why they weren't at the funeral!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.65,0:57:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不起 真的很抱歉  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, sorry again.  - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.37,0:57:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.25,0:57:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你把胡子刮掉了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've shaved it off then?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.01,0:58:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 不适合我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Wasn't working for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.41,0:58:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 确实 现在这样比较好  - 你不喜欢我原来的胡子? \N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I'm glad.  - You didn't like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.49,0:58:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不喜欢 我希望给我看病的医生都把胡子刮得干干净净\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I prefer my doctors clean-shaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.33,0:58:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是每天都听到病人这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a sentence you hear every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.37,0:58:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,现在感觉怎么样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.57,0:58:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,挺好的 有点被烟呛到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not bad. Bit smoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.13,0:58:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.69,0:58:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚是谁干的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night, who did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.61,0:58:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为什么要针对我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why did they target me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.25,0:58:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.53,0:58:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是有人想通过我找到你?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it someone trying to get to you through me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.41,0:58:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你说的恐怖分子那事有关系吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it something to do with this terrorist thing you talked about?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.21,0:58:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道 看不清这事的性质 很多线索不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, I can't see the pattern. It's too nebulous.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.01,0:58:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么一个探员会牺牲他的性命来告诉我们一个完全不重要的情报? 这太奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would an agent give his life to tell us something incredibly insignificant? That's what's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.49,0:58:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 牺牲了性命?  - 迈克罗夫特是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give his life?  - According to Mycroft.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.21,0:58:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有个秘密组织正密谋袭击伦敦 我们现在只知道这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an underground network planning an attack on London, that's all we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.69,0:58:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这些都是我的老鼠 约翰  - 老鼠?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These are my rats, John.  - Rats?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.69,0:58:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都是我的线索 有探员 有社会下层的人 都是些\N{\fnArial\fs30}My markers, agents, lowlifes, people who might find themselves
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.53,0:58:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,突然会被逮捕或者突然被撤销外交豁免权的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}arrested or their diplomatic immunity suddenly rescinded.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.33,0:58:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,如果其中一人有可疑的行径 我们就知道出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If one of them starts acting suspiciously, we know something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.05,0:59:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他们其中的五个表现得特别正常 但是第六个人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five of them are behaving perfectly normally, but the sixth...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.65,0:59:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不是认识他?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know him, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.77,0:59:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,上议院莫兰议员 世袭贵族 海外发展部的部长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Moran, Peer of the Realm. Minister for Overseas Development.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.93,0:59:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 国家建设的栋梁  - 就是他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pillar of the Establishment.  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.45,0:59:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,从1996年开始他就为朝鲜工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been working for North Korea since 1996.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.57,0:59:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 他就是只大老鼠 老鼠一号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?  - He's the big rat, rat number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.49,0:59:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他不久前的行为 特别可疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just done something very suspicious indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.29,0:59:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 确实奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.65,0:59:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他真的没法在中途下车吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nowhere he could have got off?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.45,0:59:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,从地图上看是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not according to the maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.61,0:59:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定有原因 肯定有东西我没有想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something, something, something I'm missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.05,0:59:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,显而易见的东西 我却没看到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something staring me in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.37,0:59:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,知不知道这个地下组织都是些什么人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea who they are, this underground network?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.41,0:59:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,情报组织肯定列了份嫌疑人名单 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Intelligence must have a list of the most obvious ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.53,0:59:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的老鼠刚刚钻出了地洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our rat's just come out of his den.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.09,0:59:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,会不会是基地组织? 爱尔兰共和军又开始焦躁不安了 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Al-Qaeda? The IRA have been getting restless again,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.29,0:59:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也许那些恐怖分子准备现身...  - 没错 没错 没错 我明白了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- maybe they're going to make an appearance...  - Yes, yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.29,0:59:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是个傻瓜 超级大傻瓜!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been an idiot, a blind idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.81,0:59:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了?  - 太棒了 真的是太聪明了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?  - Oh, that's good. That could be brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.21,0:59:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你都想到了什么?  - 迈克罗夫特收到的情报一点也不模糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you on about?  - Mycroft's intelligence is not nebulous at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.53,0:59:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,反而是太清晰了 难以置信地清晰 \N{\fnArial\fs30}it's specific, incredibly specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.25,0:59:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,到底什么意思?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.53,1:00:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不是地下组织 华生 他们是地下的组织!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not an underground network, John, it's an Underground network!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.29,1:00:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,显然如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.13,1:00:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等 什么?  - 有时候呈现给你的假象会特别放肆 特别不可理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?  - Sometimes a deception is so audacious, so outrageous
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.73,1:00:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,以至于合理的解释就摆在你面前 你却看不见它 看这\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you can't see it even when it's staring you in the face. Look,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.93,1:00:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 七节车厢离开了威斯敏斯特站台  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- seven carriages leave Westminster.  - Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.05,1:00:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但到达圣詹姆斯站时只有六节车厢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And only six carriages arrive at St James's Park.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.85,1:00:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 这根本不可能啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, but that's, I mean, it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.05,1:00:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,莫兰并没有消失 是整个车厢消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moran didn't disappear. The entire tube compartment did.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.25,1:00:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,地铁司机肯定调转了车的方向 然后把最后一节车厢分离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The driver must have diverted the train and then detached the last carriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.49,1:00:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他能把最后一节车厢放哪? 你说了这些站台之间什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detached it where? You said there was nothing between those stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.33,1:00:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,地图上确实什么都没有 但是一旦你排除了其它可能的因素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not on the maps, but once you eliminate the other factors,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.61,1:00:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的一定是真相 那节车厢消失了 所以它一定在某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}the remaining thing must be the truth. That carriage vanished, so it must be somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.17,1:00:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但为什么呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why, though?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.69,1:00:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要把那节车厢分离开?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why detach it in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.25,1:00:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,车厢是在圣詹姆斯和威斯敏斯特站之间不见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It vanishes between St James's Park and Westminster.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.21,1:00:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,莫兰议员也不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Moran vanishes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.93,1:00:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你被绑架而且差点在篝火派对里被烧死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidnapped and nearly burnt to death at a fireworks party.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.25,1:00:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,日期 约翰 今天几号?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the date, John, today's date?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.05,1:00:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯? 今天是11月...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm? November the...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.57,1:00:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.33,1:00:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,莫兰议员 他是世袭贵族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Moran, he's a Peer of the Realm.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.37,1:00:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,通常他都是坐在国会大厦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Normally he'd sit in the House.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.69,1:01:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,今天晚上 议员们会召开会议 彻夜为是否通过新修订的反恐法案投票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, there's an all-night sitting to vote on the new anti-terrorism bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.13,1:01:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但他不会出席 今晚不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he won't be there, not tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.17,1:01:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不会在11月5日这一天出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the 5th November.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.17,1:01:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,"记住 记住..."\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Remember, remember..."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.89,1:01:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,"火药 叛国和阴谋!"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Gunpowder, treason and plot!"
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.85,1:01:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,下面什么也没有 福尔摩斯先生 我看过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing down there, Mr Holmes, I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.21,1:01:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没有旁轨 也没有秘密车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sidings, no ghost stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.85,1:01:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定有 继续查\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be, check again.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.29,1:01:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,整个区域就是新建筑和旧建筑的混杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole area is a big mess of old and new stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.57,1:01:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,查令十字街附近有一些旧车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charing Cross is made up of bits of older stations,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.85,1:01:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,比如特拉法尔加广场站和斯德兰德站\N{\fnArial\fs30}like Trafalgar Square, Strand.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.37,1:01:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这些都不是 我们查过这些地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's none of those, we've accounted for those.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.57,1:01:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,圣玛格丽特街站 大桥街站 萨马特拉路站 国会街站...\N{\fnArial\fs30}St Margaret Street, Bridge Street, Sumatra Road, Parliament Street...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.69,1:01:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等 萨马特拉路站?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, hang on, Sumatra Road?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.77,1:01:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚刚提到了萨马特拉路站 福尔摩斯先生? 那里确实有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mentioned Sumatra Road, Mr Holmes? There is something,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.21,1:01:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道这名字我有印象! 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it rang a bell! Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.73,1:01:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那条街下面有一个车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a station down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.29,1:01:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那为什么地图上没有呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why isn't it on the maps?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.05,1:01:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为那个车站还没有开始使用就关闭了  - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because it was closed before it ever opened.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.57,1:01:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,当时站台和楼梯什么的都建好了 但是整个被禁用\N{\fnArial\fs30}They built the platforms, even the staircases, but it all got tied up
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.05,1:01:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,因为法律上的纠纷 所以之后地面上的站台就没有继续建造了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in legal disputes and so they never built the station on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.21,1:01:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,它就在威斯敏斯特宫的正下方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right underneath the Palace of Westminster.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.49,1:01:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这个废旧车站里会有什么 炸弹吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's down there, a bomb?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.93,1:02:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,很多评论家均表示\N{\fnArial\fs30}With many commentators saying
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.85,1:02:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,支持与反对新修订的反恐法案的票数将十分接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}the vote on the Terrorism Bill will be too close to call,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.53,1:02:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,议员们现在正在议院中就坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}MPs are now making their way into the Chamber for what
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.57,1:02:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,以决定政府称之为"本届议会最重要投票"的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Government is calling "the most important vote of this Parliament."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.33,1:02:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,现在连线我们的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over now to our...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.57,1:02:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们连本国人民都开始监听\N{\fnArial\fs30}What freedoms exactly are we protecting
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.61,1:02:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们还说什么保护自由?\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we start spying on our own people?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.77,1:02:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个规模空前的奥威尔式举措...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a Orwellian measure on a scale unprecedented...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.81,1:02:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,所以那里有个炸弹 对吧? 那节车厢里装了炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bomb, then? The tube carriage is carrying a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.57,1:02:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 肯定有  - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Must be.  - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.29,1:02:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么?  - 我在报警啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing?  - I'm calling the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.33,1:02:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,什么? 不行!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.89,1:02:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克 这不是游戏 警方应该组织议员们撤离国会大厦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, this isn't a game, they need to evacuate Parliament.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.65,1:02:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,警察只会添麻烦 他们总是这样 这样更方便 更有效率 \N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll get in the way, they always do. This is cleaner, more efficient.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.97,1:02:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 而且不合法?  - 有一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And illegal?  - A bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.73,1:03:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.49,1:03:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,跟上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.33,1:04:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不明白  - 你也有猜错的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't understand.  - Well, that's a first.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.29,1:04:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,它不可能在别的地方啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nowhere else it could be.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.09,1:04:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,噢!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.69,1:04:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.89,1:04:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等 夏洛克...?  - 怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hang on, Sherlock...?  - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.81,1:04:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那个炸弹 不是会爆炸的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, isn't it live?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.37,1:04:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很安全的 只要别接触轨道就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfectly safe as long as we avoid touching the rails.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.13,1:05:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 没错 不要接触轨道 太好了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, yeah, avoid the rails. Great!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.93,1:05:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,往这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.29,1:05:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你确定?  - 确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure?  - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.61,1:05:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.49,1:05:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,看看那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.69,1:05:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 约翰...  - 怎么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John...  - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.77,1:05:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是爆破装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demolition charges.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.33,1:06:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,空的 什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's empty. There's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.97,1:06:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这不就是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.01,1:07:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.41,1:07:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.89,1:07:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这节车厢不是藏了炸弹 整个车厢本身就是炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not carrying explosives, the whole compartment is the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.57,1:08:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要拆弹专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need bomb disposal.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.77,1:08:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,现在时间不够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There may not be time for that now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.57,1:08:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那该怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.69,1:08:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.85,1:08:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赶快想啊  - 你为什么觉得我一定知道怎么做?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, think of something.  - Why do you think I know what to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.25,1:08:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你是夏洛克·福尔摩斯 你是天底下最聪明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cos you're Sherlock Holmes, you're as clever as it gets.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.85,1:08:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但这不等于我知道怎么拆一个大炸弹!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't mean I know how to diffuse a giant bomb!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.97,1:08:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那你呢?!  - 我又没当过拆弹专家 我他妈就只是个医生!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about you?!  - I wasn't in bomb disposal, I'm a bloody doctor!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.93,1:08:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,还是个士兵 你不是一直强调这一点吗!\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a soldier, as you keep reminding us all!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.97,1:08:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们... 我们就不能直接把计时器扯掉之类的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't... can't we rip the timer off, or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.25,1:08:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那会引爆的  - 看 我就说你懂的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That would set it off.  - You see, you know things!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.57,1:08:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,噢!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.01,1:08:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 呃...  - 天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Er...  - My God!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.69,1:08:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,呃...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.05,1:08:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才为什么不报警?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you call the police?!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.73,1:08:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你就不能...?  - 你为什么从来不报警?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you just...?  - Why do you never call the police?!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.93,1:09:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,现在说这些都晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's no use now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.33,1:09:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说你不懂拆弹?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can't switch the bomb off?!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.69,1:09:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你明明不懂拆弹 你刚才还死活不报警!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't switch the bomb off and you didn't call the police!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.93,1:09:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 约翰 马上走!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, John. Go now!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.41,1:09:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还有什么用 不是吗 时间根本不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no point now, is there, because there's not enough time
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.29,1:09:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不能把炸弹拆掉 其他人也会死!\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get away and if we don't do this, other people will die!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.13,1:09:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,思维殿堂!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind palace!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.57,1:09:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯?  - 用你的思维殿堂!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hmm?  - Use your mind palace!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.41,1:09:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那有什么用?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will that help?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.61,1:09:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你把世界上所有知识都放在了里面!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've salted away every fact under the sun!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.57,1:09:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你觉得我大脑里某个地方就写着"如何拆弹"?  - 没错!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you think I've just got "how to defuse a bomb" tucked away in there somewhere?  - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.01,1:09:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.77,1:09:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,快想!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.21,1:09:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,想一想 认真想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think, please think.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.85,1:09:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,快想!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.89,1:09:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我想不出来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.45,1:09:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.57,1:10:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.29,1:10:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 呃...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, er...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.65,1:10:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.41,1:10:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,给我关了 天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn that off. Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.49,1:10:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 嗯 呃...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, um, er...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.25,1:10:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.05,1:10:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.21,1:10:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到 我真的做不到 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't, I can't do it, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.05,1:10:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么拆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.53,1:10:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.89,1:10:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.17,1:10:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 请原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, John, forgive me,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.89,1:10:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我的假死带给你那么多伤痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}for all the hurt that I caused you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.21,1:10:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 你装的吧  - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no, no, no, no, this is a trick.  - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.13,1:10:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的肯定又是装的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another one of your bloody tricks.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.69,1:10:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是  - 你就是想让我多愁善感一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No.  - You're just trying to make me say something nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.13,1:10:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这次不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.57,1:10:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是装好人罢了 虽然你表现得就像...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just to make you look good even though you've behaved like...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.21,1:11:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经祈祷你不要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted you not to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.45,1:11:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那可不是什么好愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, be careful what you wish for.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.69,1:11:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我没回来 你就不会站在这里...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I hadn't come back, you wouldn't be standing there and...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.57,1:11:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你的未来仍然一片光明 和玛丽一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd still have a future, with Mary.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.93,1:11:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.13,1:11:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我觉得很难开口 很难开口 说这些煽情的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I find it difficult. I find it difficult, this sort of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.25,1:11:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.13,1:11:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我认识的最好 最聪明的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the best and the wisest man that I have ever known.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.21,1:11:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然会原谅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.21,1:12:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂的犯罪网络十分庞大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The criminal network Moriarty headed was vast.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.21,1:12:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,植根于各个角落 就像癌症一样 于是我们想了一个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its roots were everywhere, like a cancer, so we came up with a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.41,1:12:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克罗夫特告诉莫里亚蒂我的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft fed Moriarty information about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.57,1:12:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,作为回报 莫里亚蒂就给我们一些暗示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moriarty, in turn, gave us hints,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.29,1:12:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,暗示他的犯罪网络规模\N{\fnArial\fs30}just hints as to the extent of his web.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.81,1:12:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们放了他 让他相信他占了上风\N{\fnArial\fs30}We let him go, because it was important to let him believe
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.77,1:12:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这一点很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}he had the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.33,1:12:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 我就看着莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, I sat back and watched Moriarty
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.13,1:12:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,一点一点摧毁我的名声\N{\fnArial\fs30}destroy my reputation, bit by bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.77,1:12:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须让他相信他打垮了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to make him believe he'd beaten me,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.81,1:12:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,完全打垮了我 然后他才会对我摊牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}utterly defeated me, and then he'd show his hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.57,1:12:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,在去屋顶之前 我们设计了13种可能方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were 13 likely scenarios once we were up on that roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.45,1:12:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,每一种都严格执行 并有独立代号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each of them were rigorously worked out and given a code name.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.13,1:12:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂要毁掉的不仅仅是我的名声\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't just my reputation that Moriarty needed to bury.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.17,1:12:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.41,1:12:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.21,1:12:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以逮捕我 可以折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have me arrested, you can torture me,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.57,1:12:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以对我做任何你想做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can do anything you like with me,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.69,1:13:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有事能阻止我的人扣动扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}but nothing's going to prevent them from pulling the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.33,1:13:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你在世界上仅有的三个朋友会命丧黄泉 除非...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your only three friends in the world will die, unless...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.33,1:13:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,除非我自杀 给你的故事画上圆满的句号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless I kill myself and complete your story.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.45,1:13:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你得承认 那样更性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to admit that's sexier.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.13,1:13:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但我没预料到莫里亚蒂的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the one thing I didn't anticipate was just how far
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.77,1:13:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,更疯狂 回想我们在泳池的第一次见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moriarty was prepared to go. I suppose that was obvious,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.61,1:13:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我想那是显而易见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}given our first meeting at the swimming pool.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.05,1:13:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他一心求死\N{\fnArial\fs30}His death wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.28,1:13:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argh!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.69,1:13:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我没有太多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I didn't have long.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.49,1:13:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我联系我哥 开始执行计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I contacted my brother, set the wheels in motion.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.61,1:13:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,然后大家就开始行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then everyone got to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.07,1:14:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是个戏法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.73,1:14:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,变戏法而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a magic trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.09,1:14:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, stop it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.25,1:14:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 就站在原处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, stay exactly where you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.05,1:14:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,别动!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.45,1:14:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.49,1:14:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,一直盯着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes fixed on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.05,1:14:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了 你会为我这么做吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, will you do this for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.09,1:14:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,很关键的就是让约翰待在我指定的地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was vital that John stayed just where I'd put him
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.77,1:14:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话 他的视线就会被救护站挡住\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that way his view was blocked by the ambulance station.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.49,1:14:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.57,1:15:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要落在气垫上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed to hit the air-bag,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.97,1:15:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.89,1:15:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,速度是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speed was paramount.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.57,1:15:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,在约翰经过救护站这段时间内\N{\fnArial\fs30}The air-bag needed to be got out of the way
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.69,1:15:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要移走气垫\N{\fnArial\fs30}just as John cleared the station.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.21,1:15:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们又需要让他看到一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we needed him to see a body.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.69,1:15:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这时就轮到茉莉出马了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where Molly came out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.21,1:15:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就像天气时钟一样 我们走这边 约翰走另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like figures on a weather clock, we went one way, John went the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.49,1:15:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 我们的自行车手准时出现...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, our well-timed cyclist...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.41,1:15:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,把约翰暂时撞晕\N{\fnArial\fs30}put John briefly out of action,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.57,1:15:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我就利用这点时间与路上的假尸体进行交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}giving me time to switch places with the corpse on the pavement.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.17,1:15:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的就是化妆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest was just window dressing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.49,1:16:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一步 在腋窝放一颗壁球\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one final touch, a squash ball under the armpit.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.41,1:16:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,形成足够的压力 暂时阻止脉搏跳动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apply enough pressure and it momentarily cuts off the pulse.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.49,1:16:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦让我过去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me come through, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.85,1:16:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没事的...  - 不 他是我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's all right...  - No, he's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.41,1:16:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没事的  - 不 他是我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's all right.  - No, he's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.69,1:16:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 别担心... 他是我朋友 让我过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, it's all right... He's my friend, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.77,1:16:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都按计划进行 有条不紊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything was anticipated, every eventuality allowed for.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.25,1:16:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,行动十分完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.93,1:16:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,茉莉 茉莉·琥珀? 她也参与了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly. Molly Hooper? She was in on it?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.93,1:16:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 你还记得莫里亚蒂绑架的小女孩吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. You remember the little girl who was abducted by Moriarty?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.77,1:16:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,出去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.05,1:16:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为她这么怕 是因为她以为我是绑架她的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You assumed she reacted like that because I was her kidnapper.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.89,1:16:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但我推断莫里亚蒂肯定找了和我长得很像的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I deduced Moriarty must have found someone who looked
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.41,1:16:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,来栽赃给我 而不论这个人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}very like me to plant suspicion, and that that man, whoever he was,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.05,1:16:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦没有了利用价值 就会被马上除掉 \N{\fnArial\fs30}had to be got out of the way as soon as his usefulness ended.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.05,1:17:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说 在太平间某处有一具\N{\fnArial\fs30}That meant there was a corpse in the morgue somewhere
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.33,1:17:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,和我长得很像的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}that looked just like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.49,1:17:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这招不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clever.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.77,1:17:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,茉莉找到了尸体 伪造了死亡证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly found the body, faked the records
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.61,1:17:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我捐出了备用大衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I provided the other coat.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.09,1:17:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我有很多一样的大衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got lots of coats.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.61,1:17:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么对付盯着约翰的狙击手的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the sniper aiming at John?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.41,1:17:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克罗夫特的手下在他动手之前把他拿下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft's men intervened before he could take the shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.97,1:17:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们让他"再考虑一下"\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was invited to reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.41,1:17:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,成了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it done?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.37,1:17:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.49,1:17:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你的流浪汉信息网也参与了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your homeless network?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.77,1:17:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过 整条街都被封锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I explained, the whole street was closed off.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.17,1:17:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,就像演了一出好戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a scene from a play.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.77,1:17:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,很精彩 是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neat, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.93,1:17:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.61,1:17:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.21,1:17:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the way I'd have done it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.77,1:17:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.13,1:17:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不是说你不够高明 但是...  - 但是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I'm not saying it's not clever, but...  - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.85,1:17:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有点... 让人失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit... disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.25,1:17:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,观众就是爱吹毛求疵 反正我来也不是为了赢得你的满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Everyone's a critic. Anyway, that's not why I came.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.21,1:17:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是?  - 嗯 我以为你知道我为什么而来 菲利普\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No?  - No, I think you know why I'm here, Phillip.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.85,1:17:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,"我怎么做到的 开膛手杰克 著"?\N{\fnArial\fs30}"How I Did It, by Jack the Ripper"?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.97,1:18:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你不感兴趣吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you think it was intriguing?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.97,1:18:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,太可怕了 你竟然觉得我对那件轰动于世的案子感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lurid. A case so sensational you hoped I'd be interested.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.41,1:18:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但你和你的粉丝们做得有点过头了 菲利普\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you overdid it, Phillip. You and your little fan-club.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.21,1:18:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是问心有愧 是我害的你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just couldn't live with myself, knowing that I'd driven you to...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.13,1:18:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你 一直以来你都是对的 我没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't. You were always right, I wasn't dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.33,1:18:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在一切都好了 是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, and everything's OK now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.33,1:18:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊  - 那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah.  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.09,1:18:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但你浪费了警察的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though of course you've wasted police time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.21,1:18:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,妨碍了司法公正\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perverted the course of justice.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.13,1:18:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,差点让我没能阻止大规模恐怖袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Risked distracting me from a massive terrorist assault that could have
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.97,1:18:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,以至国会被摧毁 生灵涂炭\N{\fnArial\fs30}both destroyed Parliament and caused the death of hundreds of people.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.85,1:18:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝! 天啊 对不起 夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! Oh, God, I'm sorry, Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.81,1:18:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我对不起你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.33,1:18:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.41,1:18:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,说不通啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.73,1:18:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道约翰会站在那里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you be sure John would stand on that exact spot?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.13,1:18:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,要是他走动了怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what if he'd moved?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.49,1:19:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你们行动怎么能那么神速?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And... how did you do it all so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.33,1:19:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他没被自行车撞倒怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if the bike hadn't hit him?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.77,1:19:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 为什么你要告诉我这些?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And anyway, why are you telling me all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.09,1:19:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,如果那些都是真的 你打死也不会告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd pulled that off, I'm the last person you'd tell the truth to!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.09,1:19:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.25,1:20:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你竟然...  - 瞧瞧你那表情!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You...  - Oh, your face!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.61,1:20:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太...  - 瞧瞧你那表情!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Utter...  - Your face!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.97,1:20:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,过分了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.13,1:20:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这次我完胜!  - 别嘚瑟了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Totally had you!  - You cock!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.25,1:20:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我就知道! 你...  - 你说的那些话太深情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew it! I knew it! You...  - Oh, those things you said, such sweet things.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.77,1:20:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道你那么在乎我  - 你要是敢跟别人说一个字 就等死吧...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I never knew you cared.  - I will, I'll kill you if you ever breathe a word of this...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.25,1:20:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 以童子军的荣誉发誓...  - 你早就知道!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Scout's honour...  - To anyone! You knew!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.89,1:20:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,早就知道怎么关掉它!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew how to turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.57,1:20:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有个开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an off switch.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.97,1:20:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定会有开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always an off switch.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.97,1:20:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没有开关的话 恐怖分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrorists can get into all sorts of problems
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.25,1:20:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,会有很多麻烦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless there's an off switch.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.81,1:20:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那你干嘛不告诉我?!  - 我也不全是在演戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So why did you let me go through all that?!  - I didn't lie altogether.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.53,1:20:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的不知道怎么关掉这些小灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've absolutely no idea how to turn any of these silly little lights off.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.41,1:20:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 而且你还报警了?  - 当然要报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you did call the police?  - Of course I called the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.25,1:20:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这次你死定了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm definitely going to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.13,1:20:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,又被我气得要杀人 和两年前一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please. Killing me, that's so two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.85,1:21:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克 求求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, please, I beg of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.37,1:21:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,有空的时候过来一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take over at the interval.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.97,1:21:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 兄弟 但你答应过我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry, brother dear, but you made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.33,1:21:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing I can do to help.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.09,1:21:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你不明白 这对我来说事关荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't understand the pain of it, the horror.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.93,1:21:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 快下楼 他们都在等着采访你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you'll have to go down, they want the story.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.01,1:21:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.45,1:21:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我太高兴了 玛丽 你们定好日子了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really pleased, Mary. Have you set a date?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.25,1:21:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们想定在五月  - 春日的婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, we thought May. - Ah, a spring wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.73,1:21:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 其实我们订过一次婚  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, once we've actually got engaged.  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.61,1:22:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但上次没有完成  - 嗯 我都迫不及待了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We were interrupted last time.  - Yeah. Well, I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.05,1:22:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你会来吧 夏洛克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be there, Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.17,1:22:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,婚礼我不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weddings, not really my thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.17,1:22:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大家好  - 你好 茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, everyone.  - Hello, Molly.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.25,1:22:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他是汤姆 跟大家打招呼 汤姆  - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is Tom. Tom, this is everyone.  - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.37,1:22:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨  - 很高兴认识你们 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi.  - It's really nice to meet you all. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.77,1:22:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,哇! 嗨 我是约翰 很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! Yeah, hi, I'm John, good to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.77,1:22:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可以走了吗?  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready?  - Ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.93,1:22:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,来杯香槟?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champagne?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.69,1:22:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.49,1:22:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.17,1:22:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.97,1:22:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 坐下吧 亲爱的  - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sit down, love.  - Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.25,1:22:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So um...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.17,1:22:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这次是认真的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it serious, you two?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.61,1:22:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我走出情殇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I've moved on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.33,1:22:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你不...?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you...?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.97,1:22:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我可不评论  - 你最好别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not saying a word. - No, best not.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.33,1:22:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还没说完  - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I'm still waiting.  - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.77,1:23:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为什么要杀我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did they try and kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.97,1:23:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,调查他们的是你 被追杀的为什么是我呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they knew you were onto them, why come after me?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.65,1:23:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么把我往火坑里推?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put me in a bonfire?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.33,1:23:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 真讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I don't like not knowing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.61,1:23:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 和你博客上被粉饰了的小说不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlike the nicely embellished fictions on your blog, John,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.13,1:23:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,现实生活可不是童话故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}real life is rarely so neat.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.21,1:23:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道谁是幕后主使 但我会查出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who was behind all this, but I will find out,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.81,1:23:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.29,1:23:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,别压抑你的兴奋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't pretend you're not enjoying this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.05,1:23:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 你喜欢回来当英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hmm?  - Being back. Being a hero again.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.77,1:23:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别瞎说  - 你不要再自欺欺人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't be stupid.  - You'd have to be an idiot not to see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.29,1:23:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢这样  - 什么样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You love it.  - Love what?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.61,1:23:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,当大侦探福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.21,1:23:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know what that's supposed to mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.69,1:23:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克 你会告诉我你是怎么做到的吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, you are going to tell me how you did it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.09,1:23:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么从楼顶跳下来还毫发无损?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you jumped off that building and survived?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.69,1:23:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的 约翰 我有不死之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my methods, John, I am known to be indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.25,1:23:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了 我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but seriously.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.69,1:23:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你假死之后 我去过你的墓地\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were dead, I went to your grave.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.41,1:23:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你会去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should hope so.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.89,1:23:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了一些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a little speech.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.81,1:23:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是对你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually spoke to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.33,1:24:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我在场 都听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I was there.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.21,1:24:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我祈求奇迹能再次发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked you for one more miracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.53,1:24:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我祈求你不要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked you to stop being dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.53,1:24:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.69,1:24:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 大侦探福尔摩斯该登场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, time to go and be Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.25,1:25:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰!\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.61,1:25:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰!\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.61,1:25:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰!\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.97,1:25:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰!\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.00,1:25:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰!\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!
